+{"sections":[{"topic":"authority","conclusion":"The authority model is self-consistent with strict ownership enforcement. Main agents and investigators have clear permission boundaries: investigators must be direct owned children (delegation.py line 150-151) and their authority is validated against fresh directory snapshots (authority.py line 85-109). Workspace versions and history inheritance are enforced through the InvestigationBinding policy which validates source_id and revision (delegation.py line 64-65, 102-105), and the spec owner validation ensures proper history lineage (delegation.py line 107-109).","evidence":[{"path":"src/traceh/supervision/delegation.py","start_line":150,"end_line":151},{"path":"src/traceh/supervision/authority.py","start_line":85,"end_line":109}]},{"topic":"budget","conclusion":"The budget system reserves before execution and settles after completion, with proper cleanup for failures. Subtask budgets are reserved via reserve_child (service.py line 105-140) and usage reservations are created before provider calls (enforcement.py line 718-725). Main agents retain final settlement responsibility as shown in the _start_reserved_usage function which handles cancellation races (enforcement.py line 645-715), and the close_account method ensures no pending reservations remain (service.py line 494-507).","evidence":[{"path":"src/traceh/budgets/service.py","start_line":105,"end_line":140},{"path":"src/traceh/budgets/enforcement.py","start_line":645,"end_line":715}]},{"topic":"lifecycle","conclusion":"The lifecycle management ensures no running work remains through coordinated admission and disposal. Creation/cancellation is handled by the AgentLifecycleCoordinator which uses admission leases and disposal scopes (lifecycle.py line 158-204), and cleanup of failed operations is ensured by the _finish_owned pattern that runs finalizers even under cancellation (enforcement.py line 312-335). Products are captured in the AgentRunReportReader which reconstructs reports solely from durable facts (reports.py line 28-90), ensuring capture happens only after successful completion.","evidence":[{"path":"src/traceh/supervision/lifecycle.py","start_line":158,"end_line":204},{"path":"src/traceh/supervision/reports.py","start_line":28,"end_line":90}]}]}
